        <mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;i&gt;The model answer holds 13 pages: the six of the tutorials, a page for each of Ex 16.1 to Ex 16.6 and Notes. Its DAX query view tabs are Tests and Checks. The register, its tests and the dispositions are the tutorials&#x27; work; each exercise adds a page of its own.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="532" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
